  "item": [
    {
      "name": "List audit logs",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "audit-logs"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "page",
              "value": "1",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "20",
              "description": ""
            },
            {
              "key": "action",
              "value": "",
              "description": "MEAL_OVERRIDE / EXPENSE_UPDATE / EXPENSE_VOID / PERIOD_CLOSE / PERIOD_REOPEN / MEMBERSHIP_ROLE_UPDATE ...",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "entityType",
              "value": "",
              "description": "Expense / Deposit / MealEntry / MessPeriod / Membership / Mess",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "entityId",
              "value": "",
              "description": "Nirdishto ekta row-er itihash",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "actorId",
              "value": "",
              "description": "Kon user koreche",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "dateFrom",
              "value": "",
              "description": "ISO datetime, jemon 2026-08-01T00:00:00Z",
              "disabled": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Sob poriborton-er list — kar-er nam, karon, ar age/pore-r puro snapshot.\n\n**Password ba token kokhono ekhane ashe na** — logger-e redact kora ache, tai notun code likhleo bhul kore faash hobe na.\n\n**Kokhon lagbe:** \"amar meal ke bodlalo?\" — `action=MEAL_OVERRIDE` diye filter koro, `reason` ar `before`/`after` dekho.\n\n**Ke parbe:** ACCOUNTANT+. Cook/Member `403`.\n\n**Expect:** `200`"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const l = pm.response.json().data; console.log(\"audit rows:\", l.length); l.slice(0,5).forEach(r => console.log(r.action, \"|\", r.actor && r.actor.name, \"|\", r.reason || \"-\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
